so spät noch hier herum, hmmm,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000A:000B:1010000F00CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hey, hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} O {{TAG:0005:0000:}} mı?!
