{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hmpf. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Echt stark von dir.

EN:
You came all the way to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
this early to play with me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} And it's
raining to boot? {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
