IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bene, sei arrivat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} qui san{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} e salv{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
nonostante la pioggia!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Ma sì,
